3327</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib0050"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other" id="oref0050"><italic>Porcine acellular dermal matrix &#x02013; PADM</italic>. Mansfield, MA: Covidien.</mixed-citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn id="d32e22"><label>&#x02606;</label><p>This is an open-access article distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-No Derivative Works License, which permits non-commercial use, distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original author and source are credited.</p></fn></fn-group></back><floats-group><fig id="fig0005"><label>Fig. 1</label><caption><p>Protrusion of large and small bowel through discontinuity of the rectus sheath.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="gr1"/></fig></floats-group></article>